<title>BRAZIL: Brazil CST to pay dividends by Aug 8.</title>
<headline>Brazil CST to pay dividends by Aug 8.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian private steelmaker Companhia Siderurgica de Tubarao (CST) said it would pay dividends in advance for all of 1997 by August 8.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement shareholders of preferred A shares would receive 2.019850 reais per lot of 1,000 shares, while shareholders of voting and preferred B stock would be paid dividends of 0.408289 real per 1,000 shares.</p>
</text>
